                                "example_id": "a45a8a98-f22f-4ec4-82f7-5ff3cf7131e8",
                                "sense_id": "6d079fbb-0d8e-3f80-869e-7ff82f20fae1",
                                "text": "It supports a hundred towns and villages and craters so numerous and so constantly changing that no two Etneans will agree on their number."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57efe5b4-abf7-4fc9-a2d3-d54471370627",
                                "sense_id": "6d079fbb-0d8e-3f80-869e-7ff82f20fae1",
                                "text": "But there are few Etneans who have not a superstitious regard for the terrible and beautiful mountain—as well they may."
